OL,3,GNEWSA'Urgency' needed to make schools
OL,4,Asafer after paedophile head jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FSafeguarding recommendations made after
OL,7,Fa "depraved" paedophile head teacher
OL,8,Fwas jailed for sexually abusing girls
OL,9,Fhave not been implemented quickly
OL,10,Fenough, the children's commissioner for
OL,11,FWales has said.
OL,13,FRocio Cifuentes said only three of 13
OL,14,Frecommendations made after Neil Foden
OL,15,Fwas jailed for 17 years in 2024 have
OL,16,Fbeen completed by the Welsh government.
OL,18,FA year after the review - titled Our
OL,19,FBravery Brought Justice - Cifuentes
OL,20,Fsaid: "I'm disappointed with the pace
OL,21,Fof progress on the whole safeguarding
OL,22,Fgovernance landscape."
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
